("badal-and-moti","Badal and Moti (story)","friendship-in-badal-and-moti","Friendship and the characters of Badal and Moti","friend","kind","share","Ria played with her friend in the rain.\n\"Friends look after each other,\" said her teacher.",["This story is about friendship, so as you read, ask: how do the two characters care for each other?","A story has characters, a place and things that happen. Retell the story in order: beginning, middle, end.","Words to learn: friend, kind, share."],"Badal and Moti is a story about friendship."),
("best-friends","Best Friends (story)","what-makes-a-best-friend","What makes a best friend","friend","trust","help","Ria told her best friend a secret.\n\"I trust you,\" she said.",["A best friend is kind, helps us and keeps our secrets. We also listen and say sorry when we are wrong.","Talk about your own friend: what do you do together?","Words to learn: trust, help, sorry."],"Best Friends is about what true friends do."),
("out-in-the-garden","Out in the Garden","playing-and-growing-in-the-garden","Playing and growing things in the garden","garden","plant","seed","Ria watered the plants in the garden.\n\"They need care,\" said her grandmother.",["A garden has plants, flowers, insects and birds. Playing outdoors is fun and healthy.","Describe the garden with your five senses: what do you see, hear and smell?","Words to learn: garden, plant, seed."],"Out in the Garden is about nature and play."),
("talking-toys","Talking Toys","imagination-and-toys-that-talk","Imagination and toys that talk","toy","imagine","pretend","Ria pretended that her doll could speak.\n\"What would it say?\" she wondered.",["Imagination means making pictures in our mind. In stories, toys can talk and think.","Make up what your favourite toy would say. Write two sentences.","Words to learn: toy, imagine, pretend."],"Talking Toys is about imagination."),
("paper-boats","Paper Boats","making-and-floating-paper-boats","Making and floating paper boats","paper","boat","float","Ria folded a boat from old paper.\n\"Will it float?\" she asked.",["A paper boat floats on water for a short while. Making things with our hands is creative and fun.","Tell the steps in order to make a paper boat: first, next, then, last.","Words to learn: fold, float, boat."],"Paper Boats is about creativity and play."),
("the-big-laddoo","The Big Laddoo","sweets-and-festivals-the-big-laddoo","Sweets, festivals and sharing","laddoo","sweet","festival","At Diwali Ria's family shared laddoos with the neighbours.\n\"Sweets taste best when shared,\" said her mother.",["Laddoos are a favourite sweet at festivals. Sharing makes the joy bigger.","Name sweets from your home. Say which one you like and why.","Words to learn: sweet, festival, share."],"The Big Laddoo is about a sweet and joy."),
("thank-god","Thank God","gratitude-for-food","Being thankful for our food","food","thank","farmer","Ria said thank you before eating her lunch.\n\"Many people worked for this food,\" said her father.",["Food comes from farmers, cooks and nature. Being thankful is a good habit.","Make a thank-you list: who helped bring your food to the plate?","Words to learn: thank, farmer, grateful."],"Thank God is about being thankful for food."),
("madhus-wish","Madhu's Wish","family-and-making-wishes","Family and making wishes","wish","family","hope","Ria wished for a picnic with her family.\n\"I hope it comes true,\" she said.",["A wish is something we hope for. Wishes about family and food are warm and simple.","Write two sentences beginning with 'I wish'.","Words to learn: wish, hope, family."],"Madhu's Wish is about family and wishes."),
("night","Night (poem)","the-beauty-of-night","The beauty of the night","night","moon","star","Ria looked at the stars from her terrace.\n\"The night is quiet,\" she said.",["At night we see the moon and stars. The world becomes calm and quiet.","Describe the night with words: dark, quiet, twinkling.","Words to learn: night, moon, star."],"The poem 'Night' is about the night sky."),
